      "body": "Completed in e3ddd7d (pushed to main). All serde-serialized fields now fixed-width: router result structs, router state maps (word_primes, max_prime, corpus_index*, expert_active_counts), facet store, sparse wire repr, and UorAttestationResult.hash_algorithm_id — all u64. JSON wire shape byte-identical with exact-JSON regression tests; pre-change manifold_cache_rust.json imports fine. get_expert_counts deliberately keeps its usize wasm ABI (Vec<u64> would switch the JS dashboard to BigInt elements). Follow-ups filed: #62 (export_state facet-store bug), #63 (wasm32 build break).",
